  "project_description": "Image Optimize | Image Optimize Binaries \n Binary processors for the Image API Optimize module.\n\n This allows optimizing images with the following command line tools installed on your webservers:\n\n \n AdvDef \n AdvPNG \n JfifRemove \n JpegOptim \n JpegTran \n OptiPng \n PngCrush \n PngOut \n PngQuant \n \n This module will not provide these tools for you, nor help you to install them on your webservers!\n\n You must specify the path to the executables if they are not located in the default shell search paths.",
